{"c":[{"name":"20260829T162700Z-98da0bcb31c97c64","text":"Do not generate column-meaning docs from migration SQL comments: the chain is a write log, not a glossary. @rel vs head snapshot is the ERD edge source; @doc is rejected.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T164244Z-bd1d99298ee63baa","text":"From skills/sr-search (uv --directory / Make UV_RUN cwd), repo-root scripts/ is ../../scripts — not ../scripts (that is skills/scripts).","type":"note"}]}
